Bind Npc 24424 Zone 11
Quest 1007 "Doom Soldier hunt"
    Journal "I promised to hunt [Ascetic Veda] 40 Doom Soldiers."
    Kill 40 of 18007, 8007 at direction_627

Requires player level >= 61 and player is karus and quest 302 is completed

Rewards
    Give 23750000 experience

direction_627 = location "Doom Soldier" about "Doom Soldier\nOne of the monsters held in the deep underground following the war against Pathos, they are also referred to as the Knight of Darkness." found "Eslant" at 331 769 in zone 11

On available
    Say "Veda is looking for you, master. But who is Veda??"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Welcome to Eslant. I appreciate your interest in our corner of the world. My name is Veda, I train in aesthetic practices here in Eslant."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "I called for you because with your reputation and ability, Eslant is the perfect place for you to improve your skills. You'll understand if you start hunting Doom Soldiers.\n\nYou'll earn 23.75 million EXP if you go back to [Ascetic] Veda after the mission of Doom Soldier Hunt."

On in_progress
    Say "The road of practice must be walked with patience."
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_627

On ready
    Say "Well done~ The work here in Eslant is better than I expected."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Good job. Are you satisfied with that?"
